**Part 5: AI as a Partner in Design**

&nbsp;  

• **Purpose of this part**  
&nbsp;&nbsp;• Introduces how AI can support the *design* of workflows, not just execute them.  
&nbsp;&nbsp;• Positions AI as a collaborator that helps shape, refine, and validate workflow structures.

&nbsp;  

