&nbsp;&nbsp;• AI contributes throughout the entire design lifecycle — clarifying the problem, proposing structures, refining steps, and testing the workflow.

&nbsp;  

• **Why this matters**  
&nbsp;&nbsp;• Treating AI as a design partner increases clarity, reduces omissions, and leads to stronger, more reliable agentic workflows.

&nbsp;

